# Following a link that leads nowhere creates its note, but not one named out of the workspace
# (`..` in it) or a hidden one (a trailing slash, #331), whoever wrote the link (#421).
# tests/drive.rs writes Inbox/Escape.md and checks nothing was written outside the workspace.
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace
keys p
wait-for Go to note
type Inbox/Escape
wait-for Escape
keys enter
wait-for Links another program wrote
keys tab enter
wait-for ../../Escaped.md: a path can't have
expect Inbox/Escape  reading
keys tab enter
wait-for Nothing.csv/.md: a path can't have
expect Inbox/Escape  reading
keys esc
wait-gone reading · Esc / q back
keys q
exits 0
